inal","quote":"儁具以状闻上〖29〗，拜坚别部司马〖30〗。﹝六﹞","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-e-p006a-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-d4f658601a73e445f18e","layer":"pei","quote":"少好学，为郡功曹。察孝廉，举进士。","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fcb66581725781dace53","start":20,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-e-p006b-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-d4f658601a73e445f18e","layer":"pei","quote":"汉朝以讨黄巾功，拜车骑将军。累迁河南尹。","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fcb66581725781dace53","start":37,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-e-p006c-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-d4f658601a73e445f18e","layer":"pei","quote":"董卓见儁，外甚亲纳，而心忌之；儁亦阴备焉。关东兵起，卓议移都；儁辄止卓。卓虽惮儁，然贪其名重，乃表拜太仆以自副。儁被召，不肯受拜，因进曰：‘国不宜迁！必孤天下望，成山东之结，臣不见其可也。’有司诘曰：‘召君受拜，而君拒之；不问徙事，而君陈之：何也？’儁曰：‘副相国，非臣所堪也；迁都非计，臣之所急也。辞所不堪，进臣所急，臣之所宜也。’有司曰：‘迁都之事，初无此计也；就有，未露，何所受闻？’儁曰：‘相国董卓，为臣说之，臣闻之于相国。’有司不能屈，朝廷称服焉。","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fcb66581725781dace53","start":57,"end":286,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-e-p006d-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-d4f658601a73e445f18e","layer":"pei","quote":"后为太尉。李傕、郭汜相攻，劫质天子公卿；儁性刚，即发病而卒。","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fcb66581725781dace53","start":286,"end":316,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-f0003-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-d4f658601a73e445f18e","layer":"pei","quote":"儁字公伟","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fcb66581725781dace53","start":11,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-f0004-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-d4f658601a73e445f18e","layer":"pei","quote":"会稽人","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fcb66581725781dace53","start":16,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-o005","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-479cc20f5d085b8b5f8a","layer":"original","quote":"汉遣车骑将军皇甫嵩、中郎将朱儁将兵讨击之〖23〗。儁表请坚为佐军司马〖24〗，乡里少年随在下邳者皆愿从〖25〗。坚又募诸商旅及淮、泗精兵〖26〗，合千许人；与儁并力奋击，所向无前。﹝五﹞汝、颍贼困迫〖27〗，走保宛城〖28〗。坚身当一面，登城先入；众乃蚁附，遂大破之。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-o006","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-6c0796a18b26f488c668","layer":"original","quote":"儁具以状闻上〖29〗，拜坚别部司马〖30〗。﹝六﹞","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p006","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-d4f658601a73e445f18e","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝六﹞《续汉书》曰：“儁字公伟，会稽人。少好学，为郡功曹。察孝廉，举进士。汉朝以讨黄巾功，拜车骑将军。累迁河南尹。董卓见儁，外甚亲纳，而心忌之；儁亦阴备焉。关东兵起，卓议移都；儁辄止卓。卓虽惮儁，然贪其名重，乃表拜太仆以自副。儁被召，不肯受拜，因进曰：‘国不宜迁！必孤天下望，成山东之结，臣不见其可也。’有司诘曰：‘召君受拜，而君拒之；不问徙事，而君陈之：何也？’儁曰：‘副相国，非臣所堪也；迁都非计，臣之所急也。辞所不堪，进臣所急，臣之所宜也。’有司曰：‘迁都之事，初无此计也；就有，未露，何所受闻？’儁曰：‘相国董卓，为臣说之，臣闻之于相国。’有司不能屈，朝廷称服焉。后为太尉。李傕、郭汜相攻，劫质天子公卿；儁性刚，即发病而卒。”","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fcb66581725781dace53","start":0,"end":317,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p027a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-23a5b83b139d33c00b65","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝六﹞遗字伯业。绍从兄，为长安令。河间张超尝荐遗于太尉朱儁，称遗“有冠世之懿，干时之量；其忠允亮直，固天所纵。若乃包罗载籍，管综百氏；登高能赋，睹物知名；求之今日，邈焉靡俦”。事在《超集》。","attribution":"裴松之引河间张超《超集》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-faef7ba1f606d6346fa6","start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p027","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-23a5b83b139d33c00b65","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝六﹞遗字伯业。绍从兄，为长安令。河间张超尝荐遗于太尉朱儁，称遗“有冠世之懿，干时之量；其忠允亮直，固天所纵。若乃包罗载籍，管综百氏；登高能赋，睹物知名；求之今日，邈焉靡俦”。事在《超集》。","attribution":"裴松之引河间张超《超集》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-faef7ba1f606d6346fa6","start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-02869ca08ac2b6f20ae8","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-dc2faa90ba912e0c8019","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《吴书》曰：“大将军何进、太尉朱儁、司空荀爽三府，辟为掾：皆称疾，不就。”","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1497ea2779d4bd47c974","start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-e7a20132612306125eae","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-dc2faa90ba912e0c8019","layer":"pei","quote":"大将军何进、太尉朱儁、司空荀爽三府，辟为掾：皆称疾，不就","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1497ea2779d4bd47c974","start":10,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
